no providers ready -- searches would fail until configured
fetch
  enabled   40000 chars max, 3 redirects, private addresses allowed (the local reader is built with the private-web grant)
  primary   jina unsupported on this port
  extractor stdlib
  fallback  jina  unsupported on this port
  jina      unsupported on this port
  cache     .cache (256 MiB cap, ttl 300s)  unsupported on this port
agent
  disabled in config
unsupported on this port
  cache     cache_dir is set (.cache), and no page cache is built on this port: every fetch reaches the origin, and the size and ttl keys configure nothing
  fallback  jina, and no third-party fetch fallback is built on this port: the local reader is the only fetch route this build runs
